---
// While Shotlight is free: one "early access" card. The designed three-tier layout is PricingTiers.astro, fed by
// src/data/pricing.json; to switch, render <PricingTiers /> here instead (see docs/website-plan.md §10).
---
<section id="pricing" class="band" data-section="pricing">
  <div class="wrap section stack" style="gap: 40px;">
    <div class="stack head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
      <h2 class="h2">Free while in early access.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Every feature. No account. No catch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="stack" style="gap: 6px;">
        <span class="plan"><b>Early access</b><span class="tag">Every feature</span></span>
        <span class="price">$0</span>
        <span class="desc">The whole app, on your Mac.</span>
      </div>
      <ul class="feats">
        <li>✓ Names every new screenshot and recording</li>
        <li>✓ ⌥ Space search by the words inside, and what was said</li>
        <li>✓ Tidy Up any folder, with one Undo all</li>
        <li>✓ Rules and smart folders</li>
        <li>✓ Duplicates and retakes</li>
        <li>✓ Sensitive guard + expiring codes</li>
        <li>✓ Full naming control that learns from your edits</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="/download" class="btn btn-beam btn-lg" data-track="cta_download_pricing">Download for Mac</a>
        <span class="fine">We’ll decide on pricing later. What you download now keeps working.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .head { gap: 12px; max-width: 640px; }
  .sub { font-size: 17px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .card {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 32px; align-items: center;
    padding: 32px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--beam); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(212, 255, 63, 0.08);
  }
  .plan { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .plan b { font-size: 20px; }
  .tag { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--beam); color: var(--bg); }
  .price { font-size: 40px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.03em; }
  .desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); }
  .feats { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-soft); }
  .cta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .cta .btn { width: 100%; }
  .fine { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text-3); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; padding: 24px; }
  }
</style>
